  <data name="About.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>ScanView scans pages, arranges them as thumbnails and
saves them as a searchable PDF with text recognition.

In copy mode every scan is printed immediately.

The design is modelled on &quot;Scanner Interface 7&quot;
(Grewe Computertechnik GmbH 2012).</value></data>
